      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "I really appreciate getting the quotes and not being chased to commit to buy as I needed the time to do my research and consider. Aaron came to our property and answered all questions we had. He communicated professionally and promptly over the phone, text or emails. He confirmed that the inverter will be installed in the garage and not next to the metre which is north facing. Others solar installers were suggesting some shield or cover which we where not keen to have. I looked into eight solar companies. We got a good deal and signed the contract. The installers arrived on time, were clear of the process and explained everything well. The installation went well and the system was up and running just after lunch. Extremely happy with the DE Energy - Aaron, the installers and the solar system. Now I can see how much power the solar system is producing , how much we are using and and feeding in the grid. Everything so far seams great. I highly recommend DE Energy.",
