      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "DE Energy sales and quoting process was well handled - helpful exploring alternative panels and configuration.Installers were very good, however the solar panels suppled were the wrong specification.When I checked the panels off the trailer I discovered that they were the correct brand (QMaxx) but an inferior panel to those ordered.  The installer denied any responsibility. I contacted DE Energy and the correct panels were provided and installed the following day.I'm not sure if this was an honest mistake or a ruse - the panels initially supplied were about $1,000 cheaper than those ordered.I guess this is a trap for any solar installation - check the equipment supplied before installation.  Once it is on the roof who knows what they may have installed?",
