      "review_date_formatted": "",
      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "The sales rep responded quickly, was on time for the appointment and asked lots of questions about our power use, the expectations I had and what options I wanted.  He then gave me a range of options to consider and emailed me a range of resources and information to read.  I was able to chat back and forward and tweak the system until I was happy and then he gave a firm quote which was very reasonable for a quality system that met my expectation of the price/quality ratio.  He was easy to deal with and there was absolutely no pressure tactics or other sales manipulations.We negotiated an installation date and he gave good advice on how that experience should be and what to expect.The installers turned up on time, removed our old system and installed the new one including other electrical work to bring our house up to standard, modified the hot water wiring to run off the new solar and showed me all of their work and explained why it was done this way.  I had several options about the relocated meters and they worked well with my requests to have it out of sight and discreet.  Their work is neat and well structured.  They cleaned up the site well and removed all their rubbish and the old system.  They were polite, pleasant and a pleasure to deal with.The post service has been excellent, there was an issue with the app for the inverter and their IT people rapidly resolved this remotely overnight and kept me informed.I'll happily recommend DE Energy.  The whole experience has been excellent.",
